---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro'
import { site } from '../data/site'
---
<SiteLayout title="Discuss a Construction Workflow | Contact Twin Tech-sudo" description="Describe a construction or document-heavy workflow and discuss a focused review, prototype or custom software project with Twin Tech-sudo.">
  <SiteHeader /><main class="contact-page"><section><span class="page-kicker">// START WITH ONE WORKFLOW</span><h1>Bring the difficult<br /><em>process.</em></h1><p>Tell us what people repeatedly read, copy, compare, check or re-key. You do not need a software specification—the workflow is the useful place to begin.</p><p><a href="/workflow-review/">See how to prepare for a Workflow Clarity Review →</a></p>{site.email && <div class="contact-direct"><span>Prefer email?</span><a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Workflow enquiry for Twin Tech-sudo`}>{site.email} ↗</a><small>United Kingdom · working nationwide</small></div>}</section>
  {site.email ? <form class="enquiry-form" action={`mailto:${site.email}`} method="post" enctype="text/plain"><label>Your name<input required name="name" autocomplete="name" /></label><label>Email address<input required type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" /></label><label>Organisation <span>Optional</span><input name="company" autocomplete="organization" /></label><label>What is the likely first step?<select name="service"><option>Workflow Clarity Review</option><option>Construction document automation</option><option>Prototype or technical proof</option><option>Custom software build</option><option>Website or digital product</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></label><label class="full">Describe the workflow<textarea required name="message" rows="7" placeholder="Who does the work, what documents are involved, and where do time, errors or delays appear?"></textarea></label><p class="full form-privacy">Do not include confidential, personal or commercially sensitive documents in an initial email. Your details are used to respond to this enquiry and discuss requested services. Read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p><button type="submit">Prepare email enquiry ↗</button><p>This opens your email app. The website does not store your message.</p></form> : <aside class="contact-pending"><span>// CONTACT CHANNEL IN PREPARATION</span><h2>Prepare the brief now.</h2><p>The public enquiry channel is not open yet. Use the Workflow Clarity Review page to define one process, collect safe examples and record the current effort. Do not send confidential material through unverified channels.</p><a href="/workflow-review/#prepare">Prepare your workflow brief →</a></aside>}</main>
</SiteLayout>
